WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.400
Little Yusuf said to his father, Father, I dreamed a dream. I saw eleven stars, and the sun and the moon, all bowing down to me.

2
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:15.352
His father gently told him, My child, do not tell your brothers about this beautiful dream yet.

3
00:00:15.752 --> 00:00:19.904
One day, his brothers took Yusuf out to play in the countryside.

4
00:00:20.304 --> 00:00:24.096
But they left Yusuf all alone in a deep, dry well.

5
00:00:24.496 --> 00:00:32.488
It was dark at the bottom of the well. But a warm light shone upon Yusuf. Allah told him, One day, you will tell them about this.

6
00:00:32.888 --> 00:00:39.080
A caravan passed by. The water drawer found the boy in the well and lifted him out. Everyone was amazed!

7
00:00:39.480 --> 00:00:47.520
The caravan took Yusuf to Egypt. Remember: when trouble comes, do not be afraid. Be patient. Allah always has the best plan.
